    "title": "EAH Housing and the County of Santa Clara Break Ground on First 100% Affordable Housing Community Distel Circle in Los Altos - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News ,\n1 days ago Nonprofit developer EAH Housing and the County of Santa Clara broke ground on Distel Circle, the first 100% affordable housing rental community in the City of Los Altos. Located at 330 Distel Circle, just half a block from the El Camino Real corridor, the new development will feature 90 high-quality affordable units for individuals and families earning between 30% and 80% of the area median income (AMI). Several units will be designated as permanent supportive housing, helping address homelessness and housing instability in the region. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
